  "title": "1.134.0",
  "summary": "What's Changed Fix Android Gradle plugin ordering for Sentry and Bitdrift by @vineyardbovines in #11767 Fix iOS startup crash when app is built with Xcode 27 by @tomekzaw in #11765 APP-3108: Strip Sentry debug code from production bundles by @mozzius in #11763 feat: add Attie link cards by @brittanyellich in #11756 Fix bsky logo appearing during screen back…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Android Gradle plugin ordering for Sentry and Bitdrift by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11767\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11767</a></li>\n<li>Fix iOS startup crash when app is built with Xcode 27 by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11765\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11765</a></li>\n<li>APP-3108: Strip Sentry debug code from production bundles by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11763\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11763</a></li>\n<li>feat: add Attie link cards by <a href=\"https://github.com/brittanyellich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@brittanyellich</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11756</a></li>\n<li>Fix bsky logo appearing during screen back transition by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11575\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11575</a></li>\n<li>Fix missing blur when default avatar displayed in the DM screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11730\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11730</a></li>\n<li>Migrate to expo/ui DatePicker by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11492</a></li>\n<li>Bump version from 1.133.0 to 1.134.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11780\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11780</a></li>\n<li>Improve OTA channel notice in drawer by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11344\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11344</a></li>\n<li>Fix Oxlint violation in OTA update test by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11782\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11782</a></li>\n<li>Show gzip bundle size diff in CI by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11764\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11764</a></li>\n<li>APP-3118: Fix Reanimated pager warning by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11774\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11774</a></li>\n<li>APP-3120: Restore avatars in iOS chat notifications by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11779\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11779</a></li>\n<li>APP-3122: cap tall GIFs in alt-text dialog by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11778\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11778</a></li>\n<li>APP-3129: proxy links in profile descriptions by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11789\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11789</a></li>\n<li>Revert &quot;Extract image compression into media module&quot; by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11804</a></li>\n<li>Extract image compression into media module by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11805\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11805</a></li>\n<li>Add FreeMix track embed support by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11781\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11781</a></li>\n<li>Add an HTML fallback for feature gates by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11755\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11755</a></li>\n<li>APP-3136: constrain known-liker click target to avatars and text by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11803\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11803</a></li>\n<li>Restore the Home unread badge for Following v2 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11785\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11785</a></li>\n<li>Add standalone New Posts pill and Storybook examples by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11786\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11786</a></li>\n<li>Bump @bsky/sdk to 1.1.4 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11784\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11784</a></li>\n<li>Link local modules as @bsky.app packages by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11792\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11792</a></li>\n<li>Updated &#x27;invite link copied&#x27; toast to use profile wording instead by <a href=\"https://github.com/RetroSunstar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@RetroSunstar</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11768\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11768</a></li>\n<li>filter timed out network errors from sentry by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11313\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11313</a></li>\n<li>Fix YouTube embed start time for h/m/s timestamps by <a href=\"https://github.com/kwy404\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@kwy404</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11796\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11796</a></li>\n<li>Fix DMs sending duplicate messages on rapid send-button taps by <a href=\"https://github.com/oluseyi-ged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@oluseyi-ged</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11656\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11656</a></li>\n<li>APP-3106: Add sharedContent and parentItem to post JSON-LD by <a href=\"https://github.com/blackmichael\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@blackmichael</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11772\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11772</a></li>\n<li>APP-3010: Show ‘just now’ for newly joined accounts by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11627\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11627</a></li>\n<li>APP-3123: Fix removal of URL-pattern safelink rules in bskylink by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11783\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11783</a></li>\n<li>APP-2980: filter expected network errors from Sentry by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11593\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11593</a></li>\n<li>Send atproto device and session headers by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11769\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11769</a></li>\n<li>Add <code>eloqnt lint</code> to catch translation errors by <a href=\"https://github.com/amannn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amannn</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11586\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11586</a></li>\n<li>Rename Expo background notification handler module by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11816\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11816</a></li>\n<li>Add placeholder to account creation date field, require field for completion by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11820\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11820</a></li>\n<li>APP-3139: update installed lexicons by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11815\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11815</a></li>\n<li>APP-3188: restore Sentry user attribution on web and native by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11831\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11831</a></li>\n<li>Adopt canonical OP thread feed fields by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11822\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11822</a></li>\n<li>Remove deprecated Android status bar config by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11499</a></li>\n<li>fix ios composer getting stuck when undo typing appears while posting by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11700\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11700</a></li>\n<li>Respect labels on embed <code>viewExternal</code> by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11825\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11825</a></li>\n<li>Disable device session headers for appview and chat clients by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11833</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/brittanyellich\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@brittanyellich</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11756\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11756</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/kwy404\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@kwy404</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11796\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11796</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/oluseyi-ged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@oluseyi-ged</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11656\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11656</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/amannn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@amannn</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11586\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11586</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/compare/1.133.0...1.134.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1.133.0...1.134.0</a></p>",
